sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Docker as Docker
    participant Backend as Backend startup
    participant Lock as Shared lease/lock
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant Storage as Private storage
    participant Ready as Readiness/API

    Docker->>Backend: Start container
    Backend->>Ready: Keep not Ready; do not accept requests
    Backend->>Lock: Acquire exclusive reconciliation lease
    alt Lease unavailable (multi-instance coordination)
        Lock-->>Backend: Denied or unavailable
        Backend->>Ready: Stay not Ready; delete nothing
        Note over Backend: Retry on the next startup
    else Lease acquired
        Lock-->>Backend: Lease granted
        Backend->>SQL: Query all summary_files.storage_key
        alt SQL unavailable or query fails
            SQL-->>Backend: Error
            Note over Backend,Storage: Preserve every file; do not enumerate for deletion
            Backend->>Lock: Release lease
            Backend->>Ready: Stay not Ready; retry on the next startup
        else Query succeeds
            SQL-->>Backend: Complete referenced-key set
            Backend->>Storage: Enumerate all private object files
            Storage-->>Backend: Object keys (not marker-dependent)
            loop Each object key
                alt Key is referenced by SQL
                    Backend->>Backend: Keep committed object
                else Key is absent from successful SQL result
                    Backend->>Storage: Delete confirmed orphan object
                    Storage-->>Backend: Delete result
                    Note over Backend,Storage: On delete error, preserve privately and retry next startup
                end
            end
            Backend->>Lock: Release lease after scan and deletes
            Backend->>Ready: Mark Ready; accept authenticated requests
        end
    end

    Note over Lock,Storage: In multi-instance mode, publish holds a shared coordination lease from before file write through SQL commit or compensation; cleanup needs exclusive lease.
